      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Formica Corporation built its first company‑made laminated‑plastic factory in Evendale during the late 1940s, launching post‑war consumer goods production.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Evendale,_Ohio",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "James Cunningham established a homestead along Mill Creek in 1789, making Evendale one of Hamilton County’s earliest settlements.",
